{"id":375,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Using magnetic forces to stay aloft, this Pokémon flies at high speeds, weaving through harsh mountain terrain in pursuit of prey."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Two Beldum have become stuck together via their own magnetic forces. With two brains, the resulting Metang has doubled psychic powers."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It flies at high speeds around the skies. When it finds its prey, Metang takes a firm grip with its sharp claws and never lets go."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"With its two brains, it fires powerful psychic energy to stop its prey in their tracks."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It adores magnetic minerals, so it pursues Nosepass at speeds exceeding 60 mph."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"When two Beldum link together, their psychic power is doubled. Their intelligence, however, remains unchanged."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"When two Beldum fuse together, Metang is formed. The brains of the Beldum are joined by a magnetic nervous system. This Pokémon turns its arms to the rear for traveling at high speed."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"When two Beldum fuse together, Metang is formed. The brains of the Beldum are joined by a magnetic nervous system. By linking its brains magnetically, this Pokémon generates strong psychokinetic power."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its two brains are linked, amplifying its psychic power."},{"games":["X","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"When two BELDUM fuse together, a magnetic nervous system places their brains in union."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It floats midair using magnetism. Its body is so tough, even a crash with a jet plane won’t leave a scratch."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"The claws 